---
source: tests/export.rs
expression: html
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>sororewind: the run failed</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1f2328; --muted: #59636e; --rule: #d1d9e0; --code: #f6f8fa; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --bg: #0d1117; --fg: #e6edf3; --muted: #9198a1; --rule: #3d444d; --code: #151b23; } }
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); margin: 0; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 56rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }
h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: .25rem; }
code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .875rem; }
code { background: var(--code); padding: .1rem .3rem; border-radius: .25rem; }
pre { background: var(--code); padding: .75rem; border-radius: .375rem; overflow-x: auto; }
pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
details { border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: .375rem; padding: .25rem .75rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>sororewind could not replay the transaction</h1>
<p><strong>reconstruct</strong> stage · <code>ledger_unavailable</code></p>
<pre><code>the RPC has no ledger 7 in its retention window; it can no longer tell us the state that transaction ran against</code></pre>
</main>
</body>
</html>
